00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.960
because it allows us to take payment for building department stuff.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.520
And we've successfully transitioned

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:24.240
the wetlands and the wetlands agency

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:27.920
and most of the stuff for the zoning department over

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.200
to permit link,

00:06:29.605 --> 00:06:32.485
So we're able to do pretty much everything online,

00:06:32.565 --> 00:06:36.485
which allows us two things. One, a lot better accountability,

00:06:37.765 --> 00:06:39.445
and two,

00:06:39.845 --> 00:06:42.085
it just goes a lot faster for the customer.

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:45.580
