00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:56.300
for the use of Permit Link and pays the fees for the financial processing if they choose to do that, it's basically cost neutral to the town.

00:06:57.555 --> 00:07:00.355
The other thing that's one of the things that's

00:07:01.315 --> 00:07:04.115
