been

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:28.225
trying to hire one or two people to staff up his office and he just can't hire enough people. He's basically said he's not going to do any more municipal work, puts us in a little bit of a bind.

00:07:29.345 --> 00:07:32.865
We put out an RFQ for engineering services,

00:07:33.265 --> 00:07:35.985
and we should have that back

00:07:36.145 --> 00:07:44.300
to look at sometime by mid June. Unfortunately, that's a little bit of a delay because Brandon was supposed to be giving me a

