00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:43.130
We just at this point have to wait and see what the bids are and then figure out how to proceed from there.

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:45.690
So, that's in the works.

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:49.130
Also, the pavement shimming

00:08:49.445 --> 00:08:51.285
on the North side of town

00:08:51.765 --> 00:08:57.285
will be starting next week. That was delayed from midweek this week to Monday of next week.

