00:16:11.945 --> 00:16:13.145
>> I, you know,

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:19.910
We have tried in the past to stick to very small firms

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.150
because their

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:24.550
